        <h2><strong>Frequently Asked Questions</strong></h2>
        <p><strong>1. Does a car wash really need a POS system?</strong> If you handle more than a handful of cars a day, yes. A POS stops revenue leakage, tracks memberships accurately, and gives you real numbers on sales, staff, and stock that a notepad never can.</p>
        <p><strong>2. Can the POS handle monthly wash packages?</strong> Yes. Packages are linked to the customer profile and plate number, washes are deducted automatically, and the system alerts staff when a plan is close to expiry so they can offer a renewal.</p>
        <p><strong>3. Is the system VAT compliant for the UAE?</strong> Yes. Every transaction calculates VAT automatically and produces a compliant tax invoice, with complete digital records ready for your accountant or an FTA review.</p>
        <p><strong>4. Can I manage more than one car wash branch?</strong> Yes. A centralized dashboard shows live sales, stock, and staff performance for every branch, so you can run multiple locations without daily phone calls to each site.</p>
